  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3.5 JackieStrategyV2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: Hmm, what's my plan...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 228f823fe8b2f4d4791ed74e46de81e1, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Killing more dangerous Waste Creatures drop better Waste Products.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 228f823fe8b2f4d4791ed74e46de81e1, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Should I work with a team again to hunt down a larger Waste Creature?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 228f823fe8b2f4d4791ed74e46de81e1, type: 3}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106824
  - content: 'No, I came back almost empty-handed last year after I froze up and
      let others do the fighting. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 487226e5dae66424ea250466920a3086, type: 3}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106825
  - content: By the time I felt okay, there were basically no products left!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 537908265661f2b44970c526d7724cfb, type: 3}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106826
  - content: "I can do this solo, that\u2019s what the past year of training was
      for."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 487226e5dae66424ea250466920a3086, type: 3}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106827
  - content: 'This way I get the full cut of the products, and it should impress
      the examiners, I hope. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 10ec818d4088de44a83a5405137230e4, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: "Although I\u2019ll have to be sneaky and careful if I\u2019m hunting
      alone..."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 487226e5dae66424ea250466920a3086, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: <i>Squelch
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3947e3a3291f4ff408639af6bfccf26e, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 174956c54b12b0d419353cc1a44153ca, type: 3}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106828
  - content: Whoops. Maybe I gotta be more sneaky and more careful.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 228f823fe8b2f4d4791ed74e46de81e1, type: 3}
    events: []
